{"text":"□水盡則景亡，□□嚮娑羅，現北首之期，負杖發□頹之嘆。物分□□，理趣無爽。故憂填戀道，鑄真金□□靈容；目連□德，尅栴檀而圖聖像。還顏攸忽，尚□□斯況之□□□于冥冥之中，生於千載之下。進□□鷲嶺，初□□□遇龍華寶駕而不豫。殖微因心□祈向，何以□□□疆，還邀三會？樹因菩提者，必資□於善友；入海□珍者，亦憑導於水師。故世王之愆□□婆而曉□□之倒，假門神而悟。由此而言，自金□以還，未有□□友而成者也。於此迭相獎動，異心□附，法儀之□□至廿餘人，各竭己家珍，并勸一切□，爲皇帝□□□、法界有形敬造石像一區。藉此微因，□□□□□□□入智海，學窮有楞，究竟常果。大誓□□□□□□□十方淨覺爲我證。永熙二年八月廿日造記。邑師……","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"娑羅雙樹","refId":null,"text":"娑羅","start":10,"end":12},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"涅槃","refId":null,"text":"北首","start":14,"end":16},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"優填王","refId":null,"text":"憂填","start":38,"end":40},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"目犍連","refId":null,"text":"目連","start":51,"end":53},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"栴檀像","refId":null,"text":"栴檀","start":57,"end":59},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"靈鷲山","refId":null,"text":"鷲嶺","start":94,"end":96},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"龍華","refId":null,"text":"龍華","start":102,"end":104},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"龍華三會","refId":null,"text":"三會","start":127,"end":129},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"菩提","refId":null,"text":"菩提","start":132,"end":134},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"阿闍世王","refId":null,"text":"世王","start":157,"end":159},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"法界","refId":null,"text":"法界","start":239,"end":241},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"有形","start":241,"end":243},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"智海","refId":null,"text":"智海","start":263,"end":265},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"十方","refId":null,"text":"十方","start":285,"end":287},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"諸佛","refId":null,"text":"淨覺","start":287,"end":289},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑師","refId":null,"text":"邑師","start":304,"end":306}]}